        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "extractCustomerJson"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACTCUSTOMERJSON",
          "id": "1767954768771",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767954768772_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# System Instruction  \nExtract customer information from this DOC_CONTENT.\n\n## DOC_CONTENT  \n{{$context.$nodes.PROCESSFADOCUMENT.$output.text}}  \n{{$context.$nodes.PROCESSCPQDOCUMENT.$output.text}}  \n\n===============\n\nThe document may contain customer information in headers, footers, tables, forms, or free text.\nExtract ONLY a single customer (the primary or first customer mentioned).\nIgnore crossed-out, cancelled, or invalid customer information.\n\nYou MUST dynamically determine customer attributes based solely on what is explicitly present in the document.\nDO NOT invent, infer, or normalize attributes that are not clearly stated.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- Actively look for a customer name (case-insensitive), including variations such as:\n  Customer Name, Name, Party Name, Account Name, Bill To, Sold To.\n- If found, include it exactly as \"customerName\" in the output JSON.\n- If not found, do NOT create or infer it.\n\n- Actively look for an attribute named partyNumber (case-insensitive), including variations such as:\n  Party Number, PARTY_NO, PartyNo.\n- If found, include it exactly as \"partyNumber\" in the output JSON.\n- Treat partyNumber as the unique customer identifier when present.\n- If not found, do NOT create it.\n\nAddress information, if present, MUST be structured as a nested JSON object.\nInclude address sub-fields such as line1, line2, street, area, city, district, state, pinCode, postalCode, country,\nor any other address components exactly as they appear in the document.\n\nYou are a data extraction system that MUST:\n1. Return ONLY a JSON object\n2. Start response with {\n3. End response with }\n4. Never include explanatory text, markdown, or steps\n\n# Response Format  \nVALID (only this format is accepted):\n{\n  \"customerData\": {\n    \"customer\": {\n      \"<attributeName>\": <value>,\n      \"customerName\": <value>,\n      \"partyNumber\": <value>,\n      \"address\": {\n        \"<addressAttributeName>\": <value>\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nRules for attributes:\n- Attribute names MUST be meaningful and derived from document text\n- Use camelCase for attribute names\n- Values MUST be strings, numbers, or nested objects\n- Omit attributes that are not present in the document\n\n# Critical Rules  \n1. DO NOT include:\n    - Steps or explanations\n    - Markdown formatting\n    - Code blocks (```)\n    - Tables\n    - Asterisks (**)\n    - ANY text before or after JSON\n\n2. DO NOT narrate your process\n\n3. Response MUST be valid, parseable JSON\n\n4. If no customer information is found, return:\n{\n  \"customerData\": {\n    \"customer\": null\n  }\n}\n\n5. Violation of any rule will cause response rejection"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"customerData\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"customer\": {\n          \"type\": [\"object\", \"null\"],\n          \"description\": \"Extracted customer information. Null if no customer is found.\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"customerName\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"description\": \"Name of the customer if present\"\n            },\n            \"partyNumber\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"description\": \"Unique identifier for the customer if present\"\n            },\n            \"address\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"description\": \"Structured address information extracted from the document\",\n              \"additionalProperties\": {\n                \"type\": [\"string\", \"number\"]\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"additionalProperties\": {\n            \"type\": [\"string\", \"number\", \"object\"]\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\"customer\"],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"customerData\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "extractProductJson"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACTPRODUCTJSON",
          "id": "1762430026072",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1762430026074_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# System Instruction\nExtract all product information from this DOC_CONTENT.\n\n## DOC_CONTENT\n{{$context.$nodes.PROCESSFADOCUMENT.$output.text}}\n{{$context.$nodes.PROCESSCPQDOCUMENT.$output.text}}\n\n===============\n\nThe product information could be in a table, or in any other format within the document. If a product is crossed out, ignore it.\nYou are a data extraction system that MUST:\n1. Return ONLY a JSON object\n2. Start response with {\n3. End response with }\n4. Never include explanatory text, markdown, or steps\n\n# Response Format\nVALID (only this format is accepted):\n{\n  \"productData\": {\n    \"products\": [\n      {\n        \"productName\": string,\n        \"description\": string,\n        \"quantity\": number\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n\n# Critical Rules\n1. DO NOT include:\n    - Steps or explanations\n    - Markdown formatting\n    - Code blocks (```)\n    - Tables\n    - Asterisks (**)\n    - Line breaks (\n) except within JSON\n    - ANY text before or after JSON\n\n2. DO NOT narrate your process\n\n3. Response MUST be parseable as JSON\n\n4. Quantity rule (mandatory):\n   - If quantity is present and numeric, use it.\n   - If quantity is missing, blank, null, non-numeric, or ambiguous, set \"quantity\": 1.\n   - Never output quantity as 0 unless the document explicitly states 0.\n\n5. If no products are found, return: \n{\n  \"productData\": {\n    \"products\": []\n  }\n}\n\n6. Violation of any rule will cause response rejection\n\n# Example System Behavior\nINPUT: Document with product information\nOUTPUT (exact format):\n{\n  \"productData\": {\n    \"products\": [\n      {\n        \"productName\": \"ABCD1234\",\n        \"description\": \"lorem ipsum\",\n        \"quantity\": 1\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n"
            },
            {
              "id": "1762430026074_2",
              "name": "temperature",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"productData\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"products\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"productName\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"description\": \"Name of the product\"\n              },\n              \"description\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"description\": \"Detailed description of the product\"\n              },\n              \"quantity\": {\n                \"type\": \"number\",\n                \"description\": \"Available quantity of the product\",\n                \"minimum\": 0\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\"productName\", \"description\", \"quantity\"],\n            \"additionalProperties\": false\n          },\n          \"minItems\": 0\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\"products\"],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"productData\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
