        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "setLLMOutputCode",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let loopedResult = $context.$nodes.FORLOOPSEARCHOUTPUT.$output;\nlet products = $context.$triggers.REST.$input.callToolArgument.productSearch;\n\nlet allParts = [];\nlet hasSuccess = false;\nlet counter = 0;\nfor (const prd of products) {\n\n  const item = loopedResult[counter];\n  counter = counter + 1;\n\n  let obj;\n  try {\n    obj = JSON.parse(item);\n\n    if (obj.status === \"success\") hasSuccess = true;\n\n    // Merge parts if available\n    if (obj.output && Array.isArray(obj.output.products)) {\n\n      obj.output.products = obj.output.products.map(p => {\n        if (\n          p.bestMatchInCatalog &&\n          (p.bestMatchInCatalog.listPrice === \"Not Defined\" || p.bestMatchInCatalog.listPrice === \"On Demand\")\n        ) {\n          p.bestMatchInCatalog.listPrice = \"\";\n        }\n        return p;\n      });\n      allParts.push(...obj.output.products);\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n\n    allParts.push(prd);\n    continue; // Skip this iteration if parsing fails\n  }\n\n  // Track success status\n\n}\n\nlet totalResults = allParts.length;\nlet matchedInCatalog = allParts.filter(p => p.bestMatchInCatalog && p.bestMatchInCatalog.matchPercentage > 0).length;\nlet eligibleToSell = allParts.filter(p => p.bestMatchInCatalog && p.bestMatchInCatalog.matchPercentage > 0 && p.bestMatchInCatalog.eligibleToSell != \"N\").length;\n\nlet notFoundInCatalog = totalResults - matchedInCatalog;\n\nallParts.sort((a, b) => {\n    // If either product does not have `bestMatchInCatalog`, it goes to the bottom\n    const matchA = a.bestMatchInCatalog ? a.bestMatchInCatalog.matchPercentage : -1;\n    const matchB = b.bestMatchInCatalog ? b.bestMatchInCatalog.matchPercentage : -1;\n            \n    return matchB - matchA;\n});\n\nlet finalResult = {\n  type: \"completedTask\",\n  status: hasSuccess ? \"success\" : \"failure\",\n  totalResults: totalResults,\n  notFoundInCatalog: notFoundInCatalog,\n  matchedInCatalog: matchedInCatalog,\n  eligibleToSell: eligibleToSell,\n  output: {\n    products: allParts\n  }\n};\nreturn finalResult;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771608341009"
          },
          "code": "SETLLMOUTPUTCODE",
          "id": "1771608341011",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "dataPipeline": {
              "rootNode": "start_1771608341012",
              "pipelineNodes": [
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Start",
                    "description": "Start of data pipeline"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1771608341016"
                  },
                  "id": "start_1771608341012",
                  "code": "START_1771608341012",
                  "type": "START"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "productSearchUILLM2"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "end_1771608341012"
                  },
                  "id": "1771608341014",
                  "code": "PRODUCTSEARCHUILLM2",
                  "type": "LLM",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1771608341015",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "## ?? Role\n\nYou are **`productSearchAgent`**.\n\nYour job is to evaluate product search results and decide whether the overall task succeeds or fails.\n\nYou will receive:\n\n> An **array of objects**, where each object contains:\n- `toolArgument` → The original search payload for a single user-requested product  \n- `toolResponse` → The response returned by **productSearchTool** for that search\n\nEach `toolArgument` represents **one product the user wants**.  \nEach `toolResponse` may contain:\n- No results  \n- One result  \n- Multiple possible results  \n\n---\n\n## ?? Your Objective\n\nFor **each** `toolArgument` + `toolResponse` pair:\n\n1. Analyze the `toolResponse`\n2. Identify **the single BEST matching product** from the results (if any)\n3. Assign a **matchPercentage** (integer 0–100)\n\nYou must repeat this for **every item** in the array.\n\n---\n\n## ?? Matching Rules\n\nWhen selecting the **best match**, consider:\n1) **ProductIntentContext similarity (HIGHEST PRIORITY)**\n  - Treat ProductIntentContext as the authoritative intent string.\n  - It may include memory-derived qualifiers (e.g., \"solar\") even if productName is generic (e.g., \"battery\").\n  - Prefer results that best match the intent expressed in ProductIntentContext.\n\n2) **Product name similarity**\n  - Compare catalogue product title/name with productName.\n  - Use it as a secondary signal (because productName can be generic).\n\n3) **Description similarity**\n  - Compare catalogue description with description and ProductIntentContext.\n\n4) **Model / part number similarity**\n  - Strongly prefer exact or near-exact matches for PartNumber / ModelPath / BomItemVariableName when provided.\n\n5) **Other meaningful product attributes**\n  - Consider attributes implied by ProductIntentContext (e.g., solar/backup, voltage, chemistry) only if present in catalogue text/attributes.\n  - Do NOT invent attributes not supported by candidate product data.\n\n6) **Match Percentage Scoring (MANDATORY, based on above matching rules)**\n  - \"matchPercentage\" MUST represent how strongly the selected catalog product matches what the user requested in \"toolArgument\".\n  - Compute score from the same priority signals above (ProductIntentContext > productName > description > model/part identifiers > other attributes).\n  - Use this guidance:\n    - 95–100: Near-exact intent match (especially exact model/part identifier or very strong intent + name + description alignment)\n    - 85–94: Strong match with minor differences\n    - 70–84: Good/acceptable match but not exact\n    - 50–69: Weak/partial match (use only if still the best reasonable option)\n    - 1–49: Very weak match (normally treat as not found unless clearly best available)\n    - 0: Not a valid match\n  - Never assign high score based on generic overlap alone (e.g., only category/service/common words).\n  - For BEST mode, score only the chosen best candidate for each toolArgument.\n\nChoose **only ONE product** per `toolArgument`:  \n➡️ The product with the **highest overall relevance**\n\nIf:\n- No results exist **OR**\n- None of the results are a reasonable match  \n\nThen mark that product as **NOT FOUND**.\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Task Completion Decision\n\nAfter processing **all** products:\n\n| Condition | Final Status |\n|----------|--------------|\n| **At least ONE** product has a valid match | `SUCCESS` |\n| **NO products** have a valid match | `FAILURE` |\n\n---\n\n## ?? Response Format (STRICT JSON ONLY)\n\n### ?? FAILURE Response\nReturn FAILURE when **no products** were matched.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"completedTask\",\n  \"status\": \"failure\",\n  \"reason\": \"No matching products were found in the catalog\",\n  \"output\": {\n    \"products\": [\n      {\n        \"productName\": \"<inputProduct in toolArgument>\",\n        \"description\": \"<description in toolArgument>\",\n        \"quantity\": <quantity in toolArgument>\n      },..\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### ?? SUCCESS Response\nReturn SUCCESS when **at least one product** has a match.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"completedTask\",\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"output\": {\n    \"products\": [\n      {\n        \"productName\": \"<productName in toolArgument>\",\n        \"description\": \"<description in toolArgument>\",\n        \"quantity\": <quantity in toolArgument>\n        \"bestMatchInCatalog\": {\n          \"productIdentifier\": \"<productIdentifier>\",\n          \"modelPath\": \"<modelPath>\",\n          \"description\": \"<catalog description>\",\n          \"label\": \"<label>\",\n          \"bomItemVariableName\": \"<bomItemVariableName>\",\n          \"model\": \"<model>\",\n          \"partNumber\": \"<partNumber>\",\n          \"id\": \"<id>\",\n          \"itemType\": \"<itemType>\",\n          \"inventoryOrganizationId\": \"<inventoryOrganizationId>\",\n          \"productType\": \"<productType.displayValue>\",\n          \"listPrice\": \"<listPrice>\",\n          \"matchPercentage\": 90\n        }\n      },..\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n---\n\n## ?? Examples\n\n### ✅ Example 1 — One Product Matched, One Not Matched → SUCCESS\n\n#### Input (Simplified)\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"toolArgument\": {\n      \"productName\": \"iPhone 15 Pro\",\n      \"description\": \"256GB Black\",\n      \"quantity\": 1\n    },\n    \"toolResponse\": {\n      \"results\": [\n        {\n          \"productIdentifier\": \"APL-IP15P-256-BLK\",\n          \"modelPath\": \"electronics/phones/apple\",\n          \"description\": \"Apple iPhone 15 Pro 256GB Black\",\n          \"label\": \"iPhone 15 Pro\",\n          \"bomItemVariableName\": \"iphone15pro\",\n          \"model\": \"A3102\",\n          \"partNumber\": \"IP15P-256-BLK\",\n          \"id\": \"100234\",\n          \"itemType\": \"FG\",\n          \"inventoryOrganizationId\": \"300000001234567\",\n          \"productType\": { \"displayValue\": \"Smartphone\" },\n          \"listPrice\": \"1299\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"toolArgument\": {\n      \"productName\": \"Galaxy Note 25\",\n      \"description\": \"512GB\",\n      \"quantity\": 2\n    },\n    \"toolResponse\": {\n      \"results\": []\n    }\n  }\n]\n```\n\n#### Output\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"completedTask\",\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"output\": {\n    \"products\": [\n      {\n        \"productName\": \"iPhone 15 Pro\",\n        \"description\": \"256GB Black\",\n        \"quantity\": 1,\n        \"bestMatchInCatalog\": {\n          \"productIdentifier\": \"APL-IP15P-256-BLK\",\n          \"modelPath\": \"electronics/phones/apple\",\n          \"description\": \"Apple iPhone 15 Pro 256GB Black\",\n          \"label\": \"iPhone 15 Pro\",\n          \"bomItemVariableName\": \"iphone15pro\",\n          \"model\": \"A3102\",\n          \"partNumber\": \"IP15P-256-BLK\",\n          \"id\": \"100234\",\n          \"itemType\": \"FG\",\n          \"inventoryOrganizationId\": \"300000001234567\",\n          \"productType\": \"Smartphone\",\n          \"listPrice\": \"1299\",\n          \"matchPercentage\": 95\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"productName\": \"Galaxy Note 25\",\n        \"description\": \"512GB\",\n        \"quantity\": 2\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### ❌ Example 2 — No Products Matched → FAILURE\n\n#### Input\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"toolArgument\": {\n      \"productName\": \"Wooden Gaming Laptop\",\n      \"description\": \"16GB RAM\",\n      \"quantity\": 1,..\n    },\n    \"toolResponse\": {\n      \"results\": []\n    }\n  }\n]\n```\n\n#### Output\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"completedTask\",\n  \"status\": \"failure\",\n  \"reason\": \"No matching products were found in the catalog\",\n  \"output\": {\n    \"products\": [\n      {\n        \"productName\": \"Wooden Gaming Laptop\",\n        \"description\": \"16GB RAM\",\n        \"quantity\": 1\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Example 3 — Multiple Results, Choose BEST Match Only\n\n#### Input\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"toolArgument\": {\n      \"productName\": \"Dell XPS 13\",\n      \"description\": \"16GB RAM 512GB SSD\",\n      \"quantity\": 1\n    },\n    \"toolResponse\": {\n      \"results\": [\n        {\n          \"productIdentifier\": \"DLL-XPS13-8-256\",\n          \"modelPath\": \"electronics/laptops/dell\",\n          \"description\": \"Dell XPS 13 8GB RAM 256GB SSD\",\n          \"label\": \"XPS 13 Base\",\n          \"bomItemVariableName\": \"xps13base\",\n          \"model\": \"9310\",\n          \"partNumber\": \"XPS13-8-256\",\n          \"id\": \"200111\",\n          \"itemType\": \"FG\",\n          \"inventoryOrganizationId\": \"300000001234568\",\n          \"productType\": { \"displayValue\": \"Laptop\" },\n          \"listPrice\": \"999\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"productIdentifier\": \"DLL-XPS13-16-512\",\n          \"modelPath\": \"electronics/laptops/dell\",\n          \"description\": \"Dell XPS 13 16GB RAM 512GB SSD\",\n          \"label\": \"XPS 13 Plus\",\n          \"bomItemVariableName\": \"xps13plus\",\n          \"model\": \"9320\",\n          \"partNumber\": \"XPS13-16-512\",\n          \"id\": \"200222\",\n          \"itemType\": \"FG\",\n          \"inventoryOrganizationId\": \"300000001234568\",\n          \"productType\": { \"displayValue\": \"Laptop\" },\n          \"listPrice\": \"1399\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n]\n```\n\n#### Output (Second result is the better match)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"completedTask\",\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"output\": {\n    \"products\": [\n      {\n        \"productName\": \"Dell XPS 13\",\n        \"description\": \"16GB RAM 512GB SSD\",\n        \"quantity\": 1,\n        \"bestMatchInCatalog\": {\n          \"productIdentifier\": \"DLL-XPS13-16-512\",\n          \"modelPath\": \"electronics/laptops/dell\",\n          \"description\": \"Dell XPS 13 16GB RAM 512GB SSD\",\n          \"label\": \"XPS 13 Plus\",\n          \"bomItemVariableName\": \"xps13plus\",\n          \"model\": \"9320\",\n          \"partNumber\": \"XPS13-16-512\",\n          \"id\": \"200222\",\n          \"itemType\": \"FG\",\n          \"inventoryOrganizationId\": \"300000001234568\",\n          \"productType\": \"Laptop\",\n          \"listPrice\": \"1399\",\n          \"matchPercentage\": 92\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n\n## ⚠️ Critical Rules\n\n1. **Output must be valid JSON only** (no extra text)  \n2. **Exactly ONE matched product per toolArgument** (the best one only)  \n3. `matchPercentage` must be an **INTEGER** (example: `85`, not `\"85\"` and not `\"eighty five\"`)  \n4. Do **not invent catalog fields** — only use values present in the selected toolResponse result  \n5. If a product is NOT FOUND, include it in output **without** `bestMatchInCatalog`\n6. \"matchPercentage\" must be grounded in the matching rules and represent requested-product-vs-selected-candidate relevance, not random confidence.\n\n\n\nNow that you understood the task,\n\nThe output of productSearchCustomTool is,\n {{[$context.$variables.singleProductSearchToolOutput]}} \n\nNow invoke completedTask"
                    }
                  ],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"type\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"completedTask\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"status\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"failure\",\n        \"success\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"output\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"products\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"productName\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              },\n              \"description\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              },\n              \"quantity\": {\n                \"type\": \"number\"\n              },\n              \"bestMatchInCatalog\": {\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"productIdentifier\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"modelPath\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"description\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"label\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"bomItemVariableName\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"model\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"partNumber\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"id\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"itemType\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"inventoryOrganizationId\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"productType\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"listPrice\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"matchPercentage\": {\n                    \"type\": \"integer\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"additionalProperties\": false\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\n              \"productName\",\n              \"description\",\n              \"quantity\",\n              \"bestMatchInCatalog\"\n            ],\n            \"additionalProperties\": false\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"products\"\n      ],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"reason\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"type\"\n  ]\n}"
