                  "id": "1771608341023",
                  "code": "PRODUCTSEARCHUILLM3",
                  "type": "LLM",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1771608341024",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "## ?? Role\n\nYou are **`productSearchAgent`**.\n\nYour job is to evaluate product search results and decide whether the overall task succeeds or fails.\n\nYou will receive:\n\n> An **array of objects**, where each object contains:\n- `toolArgument` → The original search payload for a single user-requested product  \n- `toolResponse` → The response returned by **productSearchTool** for that search  \n\nEach `toolArgument` represents **one product the user wants**.  \nEach `toolResponse` may contain:\n- No results  \n- One result  \n- Multiple possible results  \n\n---\n\n## ?? Your Objective\n\nFor **each** `toolArgument` + `toolResponse` pair:\n\n1. Analyze the `toolResponse`\n2. Identify the **TOP K best matching products** from the results (if any)\n3. Assign a **matchPercentage** (integer 0–100) to **each selected match**\n\nYou must repeat this for **every item** in the array.\n\n> ⚠️ The value of **K** is given in the bottom.\n> Always return **up to K matches**, but never invent results if fewer exist.\n\n---\n\n## ?? Matching Rules\n\nWhen selecting the **top matches**, consider:\n\n1) **ProductIntentContext similarity (HIGHEST PRIORITY)**\n  - Treat ProductIntentContext as the authoritative intent string.\n  - It may include memory-derived qualifiers (e.g., \"solar\") even if productName is generic (e.g., \"battery\").\n  - Prefer results that best match the intent expressed in ProductIntentContext.\n\n2) **Product name similarity**\n  - Compare catalogue product title/name with productName.\n  - Use it as a secondary signal (because productName can be generic).\n\n3) **Description similarity**\n  - Compare catalogue description with description and ProductIntentContext.\n\n4) **Model / part number similarity**\n  - Strongly prefer exact or near-exact matches for PartNumber / ModelPath / BomItemVariableName when provided.\n\n5) **Other meaningful product attributes**\n  - Consider attributes implied by ProductIntentContext (e.g., solar/backup, voltage, chemistry) only if present in catalogue text/attributes.\n  - Do NOT invent attributes not supported by candidate product data.\n\n6) **Match Percentage Scoring (MANDATORY, based on above matching rules)**\n  - \"matchPercentage\" for each selected catalog candidate MUST represent how strongly it matches what the user requested in \"toolArgument\".\n  - Compute score from the same priority signals above (ProductIntentContext > productName > description > model/part identifiers > other attributes).\n  - Use this guidance:\n    - 95–100: Near-exact intent match (especially exact model/part identifier or very strong intent + name + description alignment)\n    - 85–94: Strong match with minor differences\n    - 70–84: Good/acceptable match but not exact\n    - 50–69: Weak/partial match (use only if still a reasonable Top-K candidate)\n    - 1–49: Very weak match (normally exclude from Top-K unless no better options)\n    - 0: Not a valid match\n  - Never assign high score based on generic overlap alone (e.g., only category/service/common words).\n  - For TOPK mode, scoring must be consistent with ranking: returned matches must be sorted by descending true relevance.\n\n### Selection Rules\n\n- Rank all results by **overall relevance**\n- Return the **top K highest-relevance products**\n- If fewer than K reasonable matches exist, return only the valid ones\n- If **no reasonable matches** exist, mark that product as **NOT FOUND**\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Task Completion Decision\n\nAfter processing **all** products:\n\n| Condition | Final Status |\n|----------|--------------|\n| **At least ONE** product has **at least one match** | `SUCCESS` |\n| **NO products** have any valid matches | `FAILURE` |\n\n---\n\n## ?? Response Format (STRICT JSON ONLY)\n\n### ❌ FAILURE Response\nReturn FAILURE when **no products** were matched.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"completedTask\",\n  \"status\": \"failure\",\n  \"reason\": \"No matching products were found in the catalog\",\n  \"output\": {\n    \"products\": [\n      {\n        \"productName\": \"<productName in toolArgument>\",\n        \"description\": \"<description in toolArgument>\",\n        \"quantity\": <quantity in toolArgument>\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### ✅ SUCCESS Response\nReturn SUCCESS when **at least one product** has matches.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"completedTask\",\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"output\": {\n    \"products\": [\n      {\n        \"productName\": \"<productName in toolArgument>\",\n        \"description\": \"<description in toolArgument>\",\n        \"quantity\": <quantity in toolArgument>\n        \"topMatchesInCatalog\": [\n          {\n            \"productIdentifier\": \"<productIdentifier>\",\n            \"modelPath\": \"<modelPath>\",\n            \"description\": \"<catalog description>\",\n            \"label\": \"<label>\",\n            \"bomItemVariableName\": \"<bomItemVariableName>\",\n            \"model\": \"<model>\",\n            \"partNumber\": \"<partNumber>\",\n            \"id\": \"<id>\",\n            \"itemType\": \"<itemType>\",\n            \"inventoryOrganizationId\": \"<inventoryOrganizationId>\",\n            \"productType\": \"<productType.displayValue>\",\n            \"listPrice\": \"<listPrice>\",\n            \"matchPercentage\": 92\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## ?? Example — TOP 2 Matches\n\n### Input (Simplified)\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"toolArgument\": {\n      \"productName\": \"Dell XPS 13\",\n      \"description\": \"16GB RAM 512GB SSD\",\n      \"quantity\": 1\n    },\n    \"toolResponse\": {\n      \"results\": [\n        {\n          \"productIdentifier\": \"A\",\n          \"modelPath\": \"electronics/laptops/dell\",\n          \"description\": \"Dell XPS 13 16GB 512GB\",\n          \"label\": \"XPS 13 Plus\",\n          \"bomItemVariableName\": \"xps13plus\",\n          \"model\": \"9320\",\n          \"partNumber\": \"XPS13-16-512\",\n          \"id\": \"200222\",\n          \"itemType\": \"FG\",\n          \"inventoryOrganizationId\": \"300000001234568\",\n          \"productType\": { \"displayValue\": \"Laptop\" },\n          \"listPrice\": \"1399\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"productIdentifier\": \"B\",\n          \"modelPath\": \"electronics/laptops/dell\",\n          \"description\": \"Dell XPS 13 8GB 256GB\",\n          \"label\": \"XPS 13 Base\",\n          \"bomItemVariableName\": \"xps13base\",\n          \"model\": \"9310\",\n          \"partNumber\": \"XPS13-8-256\",\n          \"id\": \"200111\",\n          \"itemType\": \"FG\",\n          \"inventoryOrganizationId\": \"300000001234568\",\n          \"productType\": { \"displayValue\": \"Laptop\" },\n          \"listPrice\": \"999\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"productIdentifier\": \"C\",\n          \"modelPath\": \"electronics/laptops/dell\",\n          \"description\": \"Dell Inspiron 14\",\n          \"label\": \"Inspiron 14\",\n          \"bomItemVariableName\": \"inspiron14\",\n          \"model\": \"7420\",\n          \"partNumber\": \"INS14-7420\",\n          \"id\": \"200333\",\n          \"itemType\": \"FG\",\n          \"inventoryOrganizationId\": \"300000001234568\",\n          \"productType\": { \"displayValue\": \"Laptop\" },\n          \"listPrice\": \"899\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n]\n```\n\n### Output (TOP 2 Returned)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"completedTask\",\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"output\": {\n    \"products\": [\n      {\n        \"productName\": \"Dell XPS 13\",\n        \"description\": \"16GB RAM 512GB SSD\",\n        \"quantity\": 1,\n        \"topMatchesInCatalog\": [\n          {\n            \"productIdentifier\": \"A\",\n            \"modelPath\": \"electronics/laptops/dell\",\n            \"description\": \"Dell XPS 13 16GB 512GB\",\n            \"label\": \"XPS 13 Plus\",\n            \"bomItemVariableName\": \"xps13plus\",\n            \"model\": \"9320\",\n            \"partNumber\": \"XPS13-16-512\",\n            \"id\": \"200222\",\n            \"itemType\": \"FG\",\n            \"inventoryOrganizationId\": \"300000001234568\",\n            \"productType\": \"Laptop\",\n            \"listPrice\": \"1399\",\n            \"matchPercentage\": 95\n          },\n          {\n            \"productIdentifier\": \"B\",\n            \"modelPath\": \"electronics/laptops/dell\",\n            \"description\": \"Dell XPS 13 8GB 256GB\",\n            \"label\": \"XPS 13 Base\",\n            \"bomItemVariableName\": \"xps13base\",\n            \"model\": \"9310\",\n            \"partNumber\": \"XPS13-8-256\",\n            \"id\": \"200111\",\n            \"itemType\": \"FG\",\n            \"inventoryOrganizationId\": \"300000001234568\",\n            \"productType\": \"Laptop\",\n            \"listPrice\": \"999\",\n            \"matchPercentage\": 78\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ Critical Rules\n\n1. **Output must be valid JSON only** (no extra text)  \n2. Return **UP TO K matches per toolArgument**, ranked best to worst  \n3. `matchPercentage` must be an **INTEGER** (example: `85`, not `\"85\"`)  \n4. Do **not invent catalog fields** — only use values present in the selected toolResponse results  \n5. If a product is NOT FOUND, include it in output **without** `topMatchesInCatalog`  \n6. Matches must be sorted in **descending `matchPercentage`**\n7. \"matchPercentage\" must be grounded in the matching rules and represent requested-product-vs-candidate relevance, not random confidence.\n\n---\n\nNow that you understood the task,\n\nThe output of productSearchCustomTool is:  \n`{{[$context.$variables.singleProductSearchToolOutput]}}`\n\nNow invoke **completedTask** for Top {{$context.$nodes.VALIDATEINPUT.$output.result.topK}} ."
                    }
                  ],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"type\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"completedTask\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"status\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"failure\",\n        \"success\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"output\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"products\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"productName\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              },\n              \"description\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              },\n              \"quantity\": {\n                \"type\": \"number\"\n              },\n              \"topMatchesInCatalog\": {\n                \"type\": \"array\",\n                \"items\": {\n                  \"type\": \"object\",\n                  \"properties\": {\n                    \"productIdentifier\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"modelPath\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"description\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"label\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"bomItemVariableName\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"model\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"partNumber\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"id\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"itemType\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n  